WEBVTT

47:32.674 --> 47:35.384
Way beyond the moon

47:37.054 --> 47:41.432
In my silver ship I sailed

47:41.517 --> 47:45.645
To a dream
that ended too soon

47:45.729 --> 47:48.564
Now I know exactly

47:48.649 --> 47:52.151
Who I am and what I'm here for

47:52.236 --> 47:55.655
You are a toy! You can't fly!

47:57.491 --> 48:01.994
And I will go sailing
